* Upload structured (JSON) 10K results with splits to RaceRoster (LPT).
*   Param 1 (%1):  The RaceRoster sub-event ID.
*
*   Split marks below (2K, 5K, 8K) are sample recommendations based on common
*   road-race intermediates (Boston-style courses commonly mark every 5K).
*   Timers MUST rename event names in Events.xml AND the matching Event /
*   Field Header lines here when their actual mat positions differ.
*   LPTCheckpoint distance is set per Race Roster LPT setup and is separate
*   from course-split events.
*
*   Note:           LPT requires structured (JSON) results -- unstructured (text) uploads
*                   are not supported by Live Predictive Tracking.
*
*   Recommendation:
*     - Define sub-event IDs in Entries.INI (e.g. %rr_10k%) rather than hardcoding
*       them here or in multiple listings -- one place to update when IDs change.
*     - Run @CalcStatus.lst before uploading so RUNNER STATUS is populated.

External Report To  RaceRoster
Records Per Page    100000
No Page Numbers
List DNF
Dq Field            DNF

Header
.INCLUDE            RACENAME.10K
##%1##
.End of Header

Select              BIB
>                   0
And
Select              DNF
EQ
And
Select              Race
=                   10K
Field               BIB
Field               Name
Field               Sex
Field               AGE
Field               DIV
Field               City
Field               State
Field               DIVPLACE
Field               DIVTOTAL
Field               SEXPLACE
Field               SEXTOTAL
Field               RUNNER STATUS

Event               Finish
minus               GunStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        Gun Time

Event               Finish
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        Chip Time

* Course splits: cumulative elapsed from ChipStart
Event               Split2K
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        2K

Event               Split5K
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        5K

Event               Split8K
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        8K

* LPT split: elapsed time from actual chip mat crossing to checkpoint (not gun time)
Event               LPTCheckpoint
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        LPT Time
